WEBVTT

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.410
Where am I?

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.280
I'm inside that robot?

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.080
This isn't the time for surprise!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.820
Fight, Kuro!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.420
F-Fight?

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:48.810
I can't just...

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:52.280
I have no idea what to do!

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.390
Tachyon counter showing normal values.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.190
Spatial phase stabilized.

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.470
Demonbane has completely materialized.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:03.430
All magical engines showing green.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:07.170
Who, exactly, is piloting Demonbane?!

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.050
Unknown.

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.270
They aren't responding to
my contact attempts.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.600
I will not accept it.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.600
I refuse to accept it.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.620
The existence of something that
opposes the genius Doctor West...

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.800
<i>Final Weapon: Genocide Crossfire!</i>

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:53.350
Demonbane... My memento
from my grandfather!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:59.590
Oh, my. Was that enough to finish you?

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.960
Too easy...

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.730
What?

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.720
It's completely unharmed.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:13.340
How impudent!

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:17.640
I think I may need to get a little serious.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.140
Super-hard!

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.070
Super-thick!

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:20.910
Super-long!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.750
Super-electromagnetic drill, full spin!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.790
<i>Tornado Crusher!</i>

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.430
I-It moved?

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.090
Yes. That's it.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.330
Too easy.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.400
Fool!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.840
What are you doing?!

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.520
Damn it!

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.580
I let down my guard!

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.380
Did you see that?

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.080
You're mine!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.950
No!

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.130
What?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.220
Don't get cocky!

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.540
Found it!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:31.050
Okay, Kuro, now it's our turn!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.050
What do I do?

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:36.680
Hit 'em hard, exactly like you just did.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.290
I'll take care of the rest!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.370
I don't really get it,

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.390
but all right!

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.000
I'll do it!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.470
A good answer.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.870
Now, Demonbane, show them your power!

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:57.680
That's...

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.650
Timaeus and Critias at maximum output.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.510
Moving to Ether Dancer mode!

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.750
No way! He's going to use that?

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:10.250
Extrication Magic: Atlantis Strike!

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.580
Hit him, Kuro!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:30.840
Right!

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.350
He jumped?

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.390
Why, you! Why, you! Why, you...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.870
<i>What?!</i>

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.680
Kuro!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.360
You did it!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.480
I... I did this?

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:34.920
You! Trespasser!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.370
Can you hear me?

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.010
Who are you?

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.620
How did you take Demonbane,

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.120
the Hado Foundation's greatest secret?

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.570
The Hado Foundation?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:46.380
That voice...

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:50.280
Oh, this is interesting.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.050
Anyway,

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.890
we're sending a recovery team
there immediately.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.280
Don't move a step.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.250
You know what will happen
if you try to run, right?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.180
I-I have no idea what's going on.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.550
F-For now, I run!

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.440
Hey! Wait, Kuro!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.190
Where are you going?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.530
They'll never find us here.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:16.990
I'm tired...

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.070
Tired to my very soul.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.850
Too many things have happened,

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:22.860
more than ever have in my entire life...

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.840
Pretty sad.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.030
Now that you're my master,

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:30.190
I can't have you getting down over this.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.660
I refuse to accept that!

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.980
You made a pact.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.170
Did you forget?

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.830
Now that you've made the pact,

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.630
I will always be with you.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.970
We don't know when the
Black Lodge might attack again...

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:54.450
Yes. We need to make you a
real mage as soon as possible.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.540
I know!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:08:00.090
We need to find out more
about Demonbane, too.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:03.580
Who made it and why?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.780
Come to think of it,

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:09.060
you were strangely surprised by
the voice in that last call...

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.100
Kuro?

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.570
Kuro, where are you going?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.820
You're leaving me here?

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:20.080
You think you can escape me?

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:23.670
Kuro!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:48.010
Thus, I was forced to reluctantly
make a strategic withdrawal.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:54.000
In other words... Not only did you
fail to acquire Al Azif,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.980
you turned from the enemy and ran, Doctor?

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.430
That's...

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:05.060
That's because that robot caught me off-guard!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.240
Oh, I see!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:13.430
Your beloved Destroyer Robots were helpless
before a complete unknown.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:15.580
Is that what you're saying?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.170
You bastard!

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.380
I let you talk for one minute, and...

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:21.410
Enough.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.730
West, that's enough.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:27.590
Leave.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.660
But...

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:34.180
As you wish...

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:44.600
That robot seems to be none other

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:48.970
than the Deus Machina the Hado Foundation

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:51.900
constructed in secret.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.900
Yes. So it seems.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.580
<i>At last, it's appeared.</i>

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.110
Augustus?

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.610
Yes.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.620
While I'm gone, you're in charge.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.860
I must go and give my greetings, yes?

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.520
To the new master of Al Azif...

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:21.470
What happened?

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.700
A lot...

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:29.260
You seem like a total wreck.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.910
Indeed.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:33.910
He needs more training!

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:36.780
Wh-What are you doing here?!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.650
You're a curse!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.920
You follow me, no matter how
I try to get rid of you!

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.570
Hey, Kuro.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.380
You shouldn't talk to your friend that way.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.790
She's not my friend!

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:49.870
Then what is she?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.750
Um, well...

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.430
I'm his property.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.170
Kuro...

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.950
Wait a second!

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:01.630
That's not true.

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.580
It's not!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:06.080
What you're imagining is completely wrong!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.050
Hey, grimoire!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.690
Don't say things that people
will misunderstand!

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.920
I'm sorry, master!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:18.380
Am I going to be punished again?

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.720
She knows what she's doing...

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.890
K-Kuro is...

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.830
No, don't believe her!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.680
H-He's finally revealed his true nature!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.740
And what's my true nature?!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:34.850
This morning, he left me all alone,
on the outskirts of the slums.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:37.470
I was so lonely!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.100
How awful!

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:42.570
I don't even know what to say...

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:43.530
Please!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:47.060
I'll do anything, so let me stay
by your side forever...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.750
Master!

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.060
O-Oh, God!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:59.810
In other words, I am the original version

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.970
of the forbidden grimoire, the
<i>Necronomicon</i>.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.050
My name means the Howling of Demons,

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.070
and I'm in the highest rank of grimoires.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.060
Neglinomicon...

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.570
No!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.420
They're all friends now.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.110
Yeah, I don't even how.

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:20.100
Wow, you know all the hazards?

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.220
All hands red?

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.800
I don't know all the hazards,
and my hands aren't red!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.200
Anyway, he was an ancient Arab,
who spent ten years

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:32.830
at a place called Roba El Khaliyeh,
or "Dahna" to the moderns.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:35.990
R-Roo roba rababa kalil?

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.220
These words are too difficult to understand...

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.610
Hey, what's wrong?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.600
When did he...

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.280
You're...

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:15.710
Woman, get away from him!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.380
You're in the way.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.650
Raika!

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.990
Raika!

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:27.750
Wake up!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:28.680
Raika!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.660
Raika!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.420
Sister... Sister!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.630
You bastard...

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.710
What are you doing?!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.010
Kuro, he's dangerous!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.580
A pleasure to meet you for the first time,

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:47.930
I suppose I should say,

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.740
Kuro Daijuji.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.240
<i>He knows my name?</i>

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.850
I shall name myself, too.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.750
I am Master Therion.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:01.750
One who pursues the truths of magic.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:02.650
Kuro!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.330
Master Therion?

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:12.500
Yes. You've at least heard the name?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.630
This man is...

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.640
The Black Lodge's Grand Master!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:24.270
Yes! He is my... No, our enemy!

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:26.640
A pleasure...

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.150
Master of the <i>Necronomicon</i>.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.450
Raika!

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:33.710
Raika... No!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.970
Don't die, Raika!

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.150
You bastard.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:39.310
Raising a hand to a lady...

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.530
I guess your mother didn't rear you properly!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.210
Oh, that Sister?

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.930
I'm sorry.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.710
I'm not nearly concerned enough to worry

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.770
about insects crawling on the ground.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:58.010
Shut the hell up!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:14.460
You broke my defensive circle and
touched my body. Impressive.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.340
Don't get arrogant!

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:20.260
Wait, Kuro!

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:21.400
Stay calm!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.520
Your latent magical energy is impressive,

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:33.010
but you can't control your fighting instincts.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.110
Call Demonbane, Kuro!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.950
What are you talking about?

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.230
He's unarmed...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:57.540
But the difference in your powers is that great!

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.500
Between yours and his right now!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:03.010
At this rate, he'll kill you!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:09.810
Kuro!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.320
Fine, I'll do it!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.920
<i>Out of the sky of hatred,</i>

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.690
<i>with righteous rage in its breast...</i>

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.090
<i>I take up the demon-slaying sword!</i>

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:24.330
<i>You are the innocent blade, Demonbane!</i>

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.780
Access!

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:50.310
So, you called it?

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.370
That's right...

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.170
Very good.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:56.590
Now I can enjoy myself a little.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:08.040
But using a giant robot to step
on a guy is just unethical.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.040
Are you still going on about that?

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.040
He's far beyond that level!

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:14.950
Look!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.570
Anti-shock defenses!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.650
Above us?

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:52.650
What is it?

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.200
What's wrong, Kuro Daijuji?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.610
And Al Azif!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.760
Is that the extent of your power?

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.570
A gravity barrier?

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.440
We'll be crushed...

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.680
Pathetic.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.180
Far too pathetic.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.190
Oh, I see!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.590
What?

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:42.700
What's he doing?

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.310
D-Don't!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.520
Raika!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.310
What's wrong, Kuro Daijuji?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.620
Surprised?

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:14.530
<i>He's not human.</i>

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:19.440
<i>I can't accept him as a human!</i>

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.940
Kuro?

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:32.430
He dispelled Master Therion's barrier?

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:35.190
A guy who can't even cast a spell on his own?

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:48.010
<i>You piece of crap!</i>

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:00.980
Did I get him?

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.810
No, not yet!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.820
What?

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.570
Splendid.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:25.200
Congratulations on making
me use my grimoire.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.530
Let me introduce you.

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:36.450
My grimoire, the <i>Pnakotic Manuscripts</i>.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:41.050
That girl is a grimoire?

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.050
<i>Pnakotic Manuscripts.</i>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:46.670
Return the favor, Etheldreda.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.790
Yes, my master.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.390
<i>Abra kadabra.</i>

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:56.630
No!

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:21.020
It's just up ahead, mistress.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.010
What are the police doing?

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:36.190
I've taken care of it.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.740
I've instructed the local
police not to intervene,

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.460
and to place a gag order on the media.

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.010
Understood.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.020
That man...

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.610
Kuro Daijuji?

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.410
Hey, grimoire.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:12.930
What, my master?

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.180
What was that?

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:17.050
Is that even possible?

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:21.070
This is our limit right now.

00:22:21.070 --> 00:22:24.170
As a grimoire, I am incomplete.

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:27.790
And you are far too inexperienced
to fight the enemy.

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:29.660
I know that!

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.560
Then become strong, Kuro Daijuji!

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:36.570
If you leave Master Therion to his own devices,

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:39.130
this will happen again to someone else.

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:41.270
Someone will shed tears.

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:43.200
Someone will shed blood.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.070
Damn it...

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:52.280
I'm going to wipe that smile off
your face for good, Master Therion!

00:24:35.020 --> 00:24:36.530
Pygmalion,

00:24:36.530 --> 00:24:38.270
Doctor Frankenstein,

00:24:38.270 --> 00:24:41.300
your suffering is a thing of the past.

00:24:41.300 --> 00:24:43.990
From now on, it's Elsa's turn-robo!

